{"id":"conforme","lemma":"conforme","pos":"adj","rank":4568,"glosses":["in agreement","similar","in accordance, deserved"],"ipa":"/konˈfoɾme/","forms":{"femininePlural":"conformes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-conforme.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Estás conforme con tu peso?","en":"Are you happy with your weight?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"weight"}]},{"text":"Espero que todos estén conformes.","en":"I hope everyone agrees.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/297553","words":[{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"Todo queda conforme estaba.","en":"Everything remains as it was.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512874","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"curfew"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"}]},{"text":"Conforme leía, más me interesaba.","en":"As I was reading, I became more interested.","words":[null,{"g":"to read","l":"leer"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to interest","l":"interesar"}]},{"text":"Conforme pasa el tiempo, el dolor se desvanece.","en":"As time goes on, grief fades away.","words":[null,{"g":"raisin"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"pain"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to vanish","l":"desvanecer"}]}]}